  'conclusion.selectionOnlyRegistrationWarningSame': '② The published lottery result for {selected} participants (out of {total} entries) was reproduced from the frozen entry data and Ethereum block {targetBlock} (mined at {time}) RANDAO. The applicant hash was registered {count} times, but every registration has the same hash, so the committed entry set did not change. Why the operator retried the registration, and whether discretion was exercised during that retry, cannot yet be determined. Group formation has not been published and is not yet verified.',
  'conclusion.selectionOnlyRegistrationWarningDifferent': '② The published lottery result for {selected} participants (out of {total} entries) was reproduced from the frozen entry data and Ethereum block {targetBlock} (mined at {time}) RANDAO. The applicant hash was registered {count} times and the history contains different hashes, showing that the committed entry set was replaced. Whether operator discretion was exercised in choosing among those registrations cannot yet be determined. Group formation has not been published and is not yet verified.',
  'conclusion.selectionAuto': '② Only {selected} participant(s) out of {total} entries were selected, again purely from the RANDAO randomness of Ethereum block {targetBlock} (mined at {time}). With 2 or fewer participants no chat game is held; the reward is distributed automatically (verified in ③).',
  'conclusion.selectionAutoRegistrationWarning': '② The published lottery result contains {selected} participant(s) out of {total} entries. The applicant hash was registered {count} times and this run could not classify the registration contents, so whether operator discretion was exercised during the retries cannot yet be determined. With 2 or fewer participants no chat game is held; the reward is distributed automatically (verified in ③).',
  'conclusion.selectionAutoRegistrationWarningSame': '② The published lottery result contains {selected} participant(s) out of {total} entries. The applicant hash was registered {count} times, but every registration has the same hash, so the committed entry set did not change. Why the operator retried the registration, and whether discretion was exercised during that retry, cannot yet be determined. With 2 or fewer participants no chat game is held; the reward is distributed automatically (verified in ③).',
  'conclusion.selectionAutoRegistrationWarningDifferent': '② The published lottery result contains {selected} participant(s) out of {total} entries. The applicant hash was registered {count} times and the history contains different hashes, showing that the committed entry set was replaced. Whether operator discretion was exercised in choosing among those registrations cannot yet be determined. With 2 or fewer participants no chat game is held; the reward is distributed automatically (verified in ③).',
  'conclusion.selectionNoGame': '② The frozen entry set and the published lottery result both contain zero participants. We verified the zero-player result; there is no group formation to perform.',
  'conclusion.selectionTimelineNoGame': '② The replayed lottery selected {selected} participant(s) out of {total} entries. The operator reports that the chat game was not held because a chain/timeline/grouping dependency was unavailable; that reported cause has not been verified. This is not a zero-participant block.',
  'conclusion.results': '③ Scores and rewards were recomputed from the players’ signed submissions strictly according to the published rules, and they match the results published at https://bitcoinu.org/block/?n={block} ({reward} {tokenSymbol} in total, {players} players in {groups} group(s), {dq} disqualified). This result was committed to Ethereum at {rootTime}. Unless it is re-submitted within the verification window ({rootTime} - {verEnd}), only the rewards exactly as published can be claimed from Ethereum during the claim window ({verEnd} - {claimEnd}).',
  // E5-04: WARN到達経路はRPC読取不能だけ。未登録・lateはFAIL文言へ分離する。
  'conclusion.resultsRosterAnchorWarning': '③ Scores, rewards, and roster keys were independently reproduced from the committed entry data and players’ signed submissions, and they match the published result. Warning: the live roster anchor or its registration time could not be read from RPC, so this run could not confirm that roster replacement would have been detectable during the live game.',
  'conclusion.resultsAuto': '③ This block was auto-distributed (no chat game): the reward ({reward} {tokenSymbol}) was split in proportion to the Locked ETH of the {players} participant(s), and this tool’s independent recomputation matches the published result. The merkle root was committed on-chain at {rootTime}; unless it is re-submitted during the verification window (until {verEnd}), rewards are claimable exactly as committed until {claimEnd}.',
  'conclusion.resultsNoGame': '③ This zero-player block was canonically finalized with no rewards: the noGame summary, empty-tree sentinel root, manifest, and self-contained on-chain claim data all match. The sentinel root was committed on-chain at {rootTime}.',
  'conclusion.resultsTimelineNoGame': '③ Although {players} participant(s) were selected, the operator reports that a chain/timeline/grouping failure prevented the chat game; that reported cause has not been verified. We verified the dedicated timeline-unverified noGame summary, empty Evidence set, zero-reward sentinel root, manifest, and self-contained on-chain claim data. The sentinel root was committed on-chain at {rootTime}.',
  'conclusion.resultsTimelineNoGameRootOmitted': '③ Although {players} participant(s) were selected, the operator reports that a chain/timeline/grouping failure prevented the chat game; that reported cause has not been verified. The dedicated timeline-unverified noGame summary, the confirmation-safe closed result window, and Evidence resultCount=0 all match. This block has no distribution and intentionally has no Merkle root; the root submission deadline ({rootDeadline}) has passed, so this is the expected terminal state and no claim can be made.',
